# Implementation plan — Spec 1.13.6

## Summary

Company owners manage **customers** under **Identity → Users**: list company `member` roles, **Add** via `UserSelectionDialog`, assign Identity `users_roles`. On add, send **welcome email** always and **welcome SMS** if SMS gateway configured. On **company registration**, seed company-scoped Email + SMS **`welcome`** templates.

See [02-company-customers-list.md](./02-company-customers-list.md), [03-add-customer-user-selection.md](./03-add-customer-user-selection.md), [04-welcome-notifications.md](./04-welcome-notifications.md), [05-default-welcome-templates.md](./05-default-welcome-templates.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.13.6` |
| Prerequisite | Identity Users SA list; `users_roles` in Identity; UserSelectionDialog; Email/SMS internal send |
| Services | Identity, WebOnOne BE, Email, SMS |
