## Phase 1 — Identity customers API

**Goal:** List + add company customers; exclude filter for picker.

**Exit criteria:** Owner JWT can list/add; duplicate member idempotent.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Routes/controllers/services | `identity/backend/src/routes/*`, `services/*`, `repositories/userRole*` |
| Users excludeCompanyId | `users.repository.ts` / list users |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w identity-root`

