## Phase 4 — Template seed on register

**Goal:** Ensure company welcome Email + SMS on register.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Email ensure-welcome | `email/backend` internal |
| SMS ensure-welcome + platform seed | `sms/backend` |
| registerCompany hook | `webonone-v2/backend/src/services/company.service.ts` |

**Verify:** type-check Email, SMS, WebOnOne

---

## Forbidden

- Rolling back membership when email/SMS fail
- Sending SMS when company has no gateway
- Inviting non-registered emails in this release
- New bespoke user picker (must use `UserSelectionDialog`)
- Cross-service DB reads (Identity must not query Email/SMS MySQL)

